    {
      "id": "batch_2_6f_14_s03",
      "title": "Kepribadian (Personality)",
      "kind": "Reading",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Dari bahasa Latin “persona” = topeng. Persona dikaitkan dgn penampilan luar/ tampang umum yg kita perlihatkan pada orang2 disekitar kita berupa karateristik eksternal, yg juga harus mencakup sifat2 sosial dan emosional yg subjektif yg tidak kasat mata.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 8
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Jadi kepribadian adalah aspek internal dan eksternal dari karakter seseorang yg bersifat unik, relatif menetap, yg mempengaruhi perilaku dalam situasi2 berbeda.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 9
          }
        }
      ],
      "provenance": {
        "source_kind": "Docx_text",
        "paragraph_index": 7
      },
      "recommended_pages": [
        4,
        9
      ],
      "glossary_refs": [
        "Term_gangguan_kepribadian_dan_perilaku_masa_dewasa",
        "Term_personality_disorder",
        "Term_kepribadian",
        "Term_jadi_kepribadian",
        "Term_ggn_kepribadian",
        "Term_gp_cemas"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "batch_2_6f_14_s04",
      "title": "Gangguan Kepribadian",
      "kind": "Reading",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Ggn kepribadian adalah suatu proses perkembangan yg terus menerus yg timbul pd masa kanak dan remaja dan berlanjut pada masa dewasa.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 12
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Ggn kepribadian merupakan suatu pola perilaku, pikiran dan perasaan yg telah berlangsung lama yg bersifat maladaptif bagi individu dan masyarakat disekitar yg bersangkutan.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 14
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Bagi os sendiri tidak merasa ada masalah, yang bermasalah adalah dunia disekitarnya.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 15
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Klaster Gangguan Kepribadian A B C.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 17
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Aneh (odd)/.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 18
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Eksentrik.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 19
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Bullet_group",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GP Paranoid GP Skizoid GP Skizotipal.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 20
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Dramatik,.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 21
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Emosional, tidak menentu (erratic).",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 22
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Bullet_group",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GP Antisosial GP Borderline GP Histrionik GP Narsisistik.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 23
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Cemas & Ketakutan.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 24
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Bullet_group",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GP Menghindar GP Dependen GP Obsesif.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 25
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Paragraph",
          "text": "Kompulsif.",
          "provenance": {
            "source_kind": "Docx_text",
            "paragraph_index": 26
          }
        },
        {
